VAR npcEmotion = "Angry"

Agent Kim, congratulations on another completed Mission, you are getting a good heck of this. #speaker: Maggie

Phone Rings ...... #speaker: Phone
-> MastermindBriefing

=== MastermindBriefing ===  
Agent, this is it. We’ve tracked down Mastermind. #speaker:Maggie  

His network is collapsing, but he’s not going down without a fight. He’s deployed **automated bots** to flood every channel with his fake stories, and his strongest supporters are guarding his hideout. **This is our last chance to shut him down for good.** #speaker:Maggie  

* What’s the plan? #speaker:Player  
    First, you need to cut off his influence. **Find and destroy his bot network.** They’re hiding in different locations, spreading his messages. **Take them down, and you weaken his grip on the city.** #speaker:Maggie  

    Once the bots are offline, it’s time for the final step: **confront Mastermind.** He won’t run. He thinks he’s won. But you’re going to prove him wrong. **Defeat him, and end this once and for all.** #speaker:Maggie  
    -> NextStep  

=== NextStep ===  
This won’t be easy. Mastermind **has prepared for this.** Expect heavy resistance—his bots are armed, and his followers will defend him to the end. #speaker:Maggie  

But we believe in you. You’ve **trained for this moment.** Everything you’ve learned, every skill you’ve mastered—it all leads here. #speaker:Maggie  

* I won’t fail. It’s time to put an end to this. #speaker:Player  
    Good luck, Agent. **Let’s take him down.** #speaker:Maggie  
-> END
